                    </div>
                    <p className="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-4xl">
                        The system has detected an <b className="text-white">Infinite RLS Recursion</b> loop. This happens when your security policies try to query the same table they are protecting. 
                        <br/><br/>
                        <span className="text-red-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs flex items-center gap-2">
                           <Info size={14} /> Ultimate Resolution Script:
                        </span>
                        This script creates a <b>Security Definer</b> helper function to break the loop and applies fail-safe UUID validation for user signups.
                    </p>
                    <div className="relative group">
                        <div className="bg-black/95 rounded-[2rem] border border-gray-800 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
                            <div className="bg-gray-900 px-8 py-3 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-800">
